<title>AUSTRALIA: Citibank Australia appoints global mkts strategist.</title>
<headline>Citibank Australia appoints global mkts strategist.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Australia has appointed Peter Clay to a new position within the bank of global markets strategist.</p>
<p>Clay, to be based in Sydney, will provide specific market analysis to complement the research of the economics department, as well as customised trading solutions and forecasts.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Citibank, Clay had worked for the Commonwealth Bank of Australia and St George Bank.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
